# Next.js conventions

- App Router in `src/app/`. Shared UI in `src/components/` (brand graphics under `brand/`).
- Default to Server Components. Add `"use client"` only for state, effects, or click tracking.
- Use `next/link` and `next/image` (`images.unoptimized` is on for static export).
- Metadata via `buildMetadata()` in `src/lib/seo.ts`. JSON-LD via `<JsonLd />`.
- Trailing slashes are on — internal hrefs should end with `/` except the home `/`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — client page, invented price, TanStack Link
"use client";
<Link to="/routes/$slug" params={{ slug }}>{price}€</Link>

// ✅ GOOD — server page, data module, Next Link
import Link from "next/link";
<Link href={`/routes/${route.slug}/`}>{route.origin.name} → {route.destination.name}</Link>
```

- Inquiry state lives in `InquiryProvider`. Do not store the phone number anywhere except the WhatsApp message.
